              "config": {
                "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong>Emergency Termination</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; color: #236fa1;\"><strong>Step 1 of 2</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Welcome <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">{{$.form.input.username}}</span> !!</strong></p>\n<p>You have selected to immediately terminate an active worker.</p>\n<p>This is a task which is audited and should not be entered into without thoughtful consideration.  If you need more information or guidance, please review the <a href=\"https://www.sailpoint.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Emergency Termination Policy</a>.</p>\n<p>You can also reach out for help via Slack in <strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">#help-emergency-termination</span></strong>.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                "label": "Instructions",
                "showLabel": false
